    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="13.18.008"></a>Division 13-18-008<br />Enforcement</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1318008.html#13.18.008.0001">13-18-008-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Enforcement</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.18.008.0001"><a name="13.18.008.0001">13-18-008-0001</a> Enforcement</h3>
            <p class="P0">If the responsible property owner fails to perform required maintenance within the time period provided in the notice by the City, or if an immediate hazard exists by virtue of unperformed maintenance, the City shall have the right to perform such maintenance at the expense of the property owner.</p>

            <p class="P0">The City shall have the right to prune or remove plant material upon private property at the expense of the property owner when it: (A) interferes with the proper spread of light along the street from a street light, (B) interferes with the visibility of any traffic control device or sign, or (C) otherwise poses a threat to the public safety.</p>

            <p class="P0">The costs of such maintenance shall be assessed against the property owner and shall constitute a lien on the property until paid. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017)</p>

    </div>
